{"suttaId":"tha-ap536","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[4192,4317],"vripara":"108"},"segments":{"tha-ap536:0.3":"Dabbamallaputtattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap536:1.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbalokavidū muni;","tha-ap536:1.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji cakkhumā.","tha-ap536:2.1":"“Ovādako viññāpako, tārako sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap536:2.3":"Desanākusalo buddho, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap536:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, hitesī sabbapāṇinaṃ;","tha-ap536:3.3":"Sampatte titthiye sabbe, pañcasīle patiṭṭhapi [patiṭṭhahi (syā. ka.)].","tha-ap536:4.1":"“Evaṃ nirākulaṃ āsi, suññataṃ [suññakaṃ (sī.) evamuparipi] titthiyehi ca;","tha-ap536:4.3":"Vicittaṃ arahantehi, vasībhūtehi tādibhi.","tha-ap536:5.1":"“Ratanānaṭṭhapaññāsaṃ, uggato so mahāmuni;","tha-ap536:5.3":"Kañcanagghiyasaṅkāso, bāttiṃsavaralakkhaṇo.","tha-ap536:6.1":"“Vassasatasahassāni, āyu vijjati tāvade;","tha-ap536:6.3":"Tāvatā tiṭṭhamāno so, tāresi janataṃ bahuṃ.","tha-ap536:7.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, seṭṭhiputto mahāyaso;","tha-ap536:7.3":"Upetvā lokapajjotaṃ, assosiṃ dhammadesanaṃ.","tha-ap536:8.1":"“Senāsanāni bhikkhūnaṃ, paññāpentaṃ sasāvakaṃ;","tha-ap536:8.3":"Kittayantassa vacanaṃ, suṇitvā mudito ahaṃ.","tha-ap536:9.1":"“Adhikāraṃ sasaṅghassa, katvā tassa mahesino;","tha-ap536:9.3":"Nipacca sirasā pāde, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ.","tha-ap536:10.1":"“Tadāha sa mahāvīro, mama kammaṃ pakittayaṃ;","tha-ap536:10.3":"‘Yo sasaṅghamabhojesi, sattāhaṃ lokanāyakaṃ.","tha-ap536:11.1":"“‘Soyaṃ kamalapattakkho, sīhaṃso kanakattaco;","tha-ap536:11.3":"Mama pādamūle nipati [patito (pī.)], patthayaṃ ṭhānamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap536:12.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","tha-ap536:12.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","tha-ap536:13.1":"“‘Sāvako tassa buddhassa, dabbo nāmena vissuto;","tha-ap536:13.3":"Senāsanapaññāpako, aggo hessatiyaṃ tadā’.","tha-ap536:14.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap536:14.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap536:15.1":"“Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, devarajjamakārayiṃ;","tha-ap536:15.3":"Satānaṃ pañcakkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ.","tha-ap536:16.1":"“Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ;","tha-ap536:16.3":"Sabbattha sukhito āsiṃ, tassa kammassa vāhasā.","tha-ap536:17.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;","tha-ap536:17.3":"Uppajji cārudassano [cārunayano (sī. syā. pī.)], sabbadhammavipassako.","tha-ap536:18.1":"“Duṭṭhacitto upavadiṃ, sāvakaṃ tassa tādino;","tha-ap536:18.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇaṃ, suddhoti ca vijāniya.","tha-ap536:19.1":"“Tasseva naravīrassa, sāvakānaṃ mahesinaṃ;","tha-ap536:19.3":"Salākañca gahetvāna [salākaṃ paggahetvāna (sī. pī.)], khīrodanamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap536:20.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","tha-ap536:20.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap536:21.1":"“Sāsanaṃ jotayitvāna, abhibhuyya kutitthiye;","tha-ap536:21.3":"Vineyye vinayitvāva, nibbuto so sasāvako.","tha-ap536:22.1":"“Sasisse nibbute nāthe, atthamentamhi sāsane;","tha-ap536:22.3":"Devā kandiṃsu saṃviggā, muttakesā rudammukhā.","tha-ap536:23.1":"“Nibbāyissati dhammakkho, na passissāma subbate;","tha-ap536:23.3":"Na suṇissāma saddhammaṃ, aho no appapuññatā.","tha-ap536:24.1":"“Tadāyaṃ pathavī sabbā, acalā sā calācalā [calācalī (sī.), pulāpulī (syā.)];","tha-ap536:24.3":"Sāgaro ca sasokova, vinadī karuṇaṃ giraṃ.","tha-ap536:25.1":"“Catuddisā dundubhiyo, nādayiṃsu amānusā;","tha-ap536:25.3":"Samantato asaniyo, phaliṃsu ca bhayāvahā.","tha-ap536:26.1":"“Ukkā patiṃsu nabhasā, dhūmaketu ca dissati;","tha-ap536:26.3":"Sadhūmā jālavaṭṭā ca [sabbathalajasattā ca (sī.)], raviṃsu karuṇaṃ migā.","tha-ap536:27.1":"“Uppāde dāruṇe disvā, sāsanatthaṅgasūcake;","tha-ap536:27.3":"Saṃviggā bhikkhavo satta, cintayimha mayaṃ tadā.","tha-ap536:28.1":"“Sāsanena vināmhākaṃ, jīvitena alaṃ mayaṃ;","tha-ap536:28.3":"Pavisitvā mahāraññaṃ, yuñjāma jinasāsanaṃ.","tha-ap536:29.1":"“Addasamha tadāraññe, ubbiddhaṃ selamuttamaṃ;","tha-ap536:29.3":"Nisseṇiyā tamāruyha, nisseṇiṃ pātayimhase.","tha-ap536:30.1":"“Tadā ovadi no thero, buddhuppādo sudullabho;","tha-ap536:30.3":"Saddhātidullabhā laddhā, thokaṃ sesañca sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap536:31.1":"“Nipatanti khaṇātītā, anante dukkhasāgare;","tha-ap536:31.3":"Tasmā payogo kattabbo, yāva ṭhāti mune mataṃ [yāva tiṭṭhati sāsanaṃ (syā.)].","tha-ap536:32.1":"“Arahā āsi so thero, anāgāmī tadānugo;","tha-ap536:32.3":"Susīlā itare yuttā, devalokaṃ agamhase.","tha-ap536:33.1":"“Nibbuto tiṇṇasaṃsāro, suddhāvāse ca ekako;","tha-ap536:33.3":"Ahañca pakkusāti ca, sabhiyo bāhiyo tathā.","tha-ap536:34.1":"“Kumārakassapo ceva, tattha tatthūpagā mayaṃ;","tha-ap536:34.3":"Saṃsārabandhanā muttā, gotamenānukampitā.","tha-ap536:35.1":"“Mallesu kusinārāyaṃ, jāto gabbheva me sato;","tha-ap536:35.3":"Mātā matā citāruḷhā, tato nippatito ahaṃ.","tha-ap536:36.1":"“Patito dabbapuñjamhi, tato dabboti vissuto;","tha-ap536:36.3":"Brahmacārībalenāhaṃ, vimutto sattavassiko.","tha-ap536:37.1":"“Khīrodanabalenāhaṃ, pañcahaṅgehupāgato;","tha-ap536:37.3":"Khīṇāsavopavādena, pāpehi bahucodito.","tha-ap536:38.1":"“Ubho puññañca pāpañca, vītivattomhi dānihaṃ;","tha-ap536:38.3":"Patvāna paramaṃ santiṃ, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap536:39.1":"“Senāsanaṃ paññāpayiṃ, hāsayitvāna subbate;","tha-ap536:39.3":"Jino tasmiṃ guṇe tuṭṭho, etadagge ṭhapesi maṃ.","tha-ap536:40.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap536:41.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap536:42.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap536:43.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dabbamallaputto thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap536:44.1":"Dabbamallaputtattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3440,"to":3443,"paras":[{"para":3440,"vripara":"108","refs":["tha-ap536:1"],"lines":["Thero attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>padumuttaro nāma jino</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ heṭṭhā vuttatthameva.","Ito ekanavute kappe vipassī nāma nāyako loke uppajjīti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap536:1"],["tha-ap536:1"],["tha-ap536:1"]]},{"para":3441,"vripara":"125","refs":["tha-ap536:18"],"lines":["<b>Duṭṭhacitto</b>ti dūsitacitto asādhusaṅgamena apasannacittoti attho.","<b>Upavadiṃ sāvakaṃ tassā</b>ti tassa bhagavato khīṇāsavaṃ sāvakaṃ upavadiṃ, upari abhūtaṃ vacanaṃ āropesiṃ, abbhakkhānaṃ akāsinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap536:18"],["tha-ap536:18"]]},{"para":3442,"vripara":"132","refs":["tha-ap536:25"],"lines":["<b>Dundubhiyo</b>ti dunduṃ iti saddāyanato dundubhisaṅkhātā bheriyo.","<b>Nādayiṃsū</b>ti saddaṃ kariṃsu.","<b>Samantato asaniyo</b>ti sabbadisābhāgato asane vināsane niyuttoti asaniyo, devadaṇḍā bhayāvahā phaliṃsūti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap536:25"],["tha-ap536:25"],["tha-ap536:25"]]},{"para":3443,"vripara":"133","refs":["tha-ap536:26"],"lines":["<b>Ukkā patiṃsu nabhasā</b>ti ākāsato aggikkhandhā ca patiṃsūti attho.","<b>Dhūmaketu ca dissatī</b>ti dhūmarājisahito aggikkhandho ca dissati paññāyatīti attho.","Sesaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap536:26"],["tha-ap536:26"],["tha-ap536:26"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap536:1.1","padumuttaro nāma jino",0,0],["tha-ap536:18.1","duṭṭhacitto",1,0],["tha-ap536:18.1","upavadiṃ sāvakaṃ tassā",1,1],["tha-ap536:25.1","dundubhiyo",2,0],["tha-ap536:25.1","nādayiṃsū",2,1],["tha-ap536:25.3","samantato asaniyo",2,2],["tha-ap536:26.1","ukkā patiṃsu nabhasā",3,0],["tha-ap536:26.1","dhūmaketu ca dissatī",3,1]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
